WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.969
Folio helps your team plan ad tests, review the videos, and learn what actually sells.

2
00:00:07.019 --> 00:00:08.568
This is Home.

3
00:00:08.618 --> 00:00:13.968
It shows what needs you today, like ads ready to review, and this week's winners.

4
00:00:14.968 --> 00:00:17.805
Briefs is where every ad starts.

5
00:00:17.855 --> 00:00:19.226
Let's open one.

6
00:00:19.276 --> 00:00:26.241
Every brief opens on the canvas, where your team writes it: reference ads, hook ideas and the shoot list.

7
00:00:26.291 --> 00:00:29.386
Page shows the same brief, organized.

8
00:00:29.436 --> 00:00:35.516
It holds the angle, the test, and the one thing it changes, here the hook.

9
00:00:35.566 --> 00:00:42.034
Each variation has its own hook, body and call to action, with its results right next to it.

10
00:00:43.034 --> 00:00:47.942
When an editor or creator finishes a video, it lands in Submissions.

11
00:00:47.992 --> 00:00:50.712
Click one to watch it right here.

12
00:00:50.762 --> 00:00:54.655
Ask for changes, or accept it so it's ready to upload.

13
00:00:54.705 --> 00:00:57.623
Every video stays linked to its brief.

14
00:00:58.623 --> 00:01:07.560
Ads and results pulls spend and ROAS from your Meta account, and marks each ad a winner or a loser against your own targets.

15
00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:11.109
Open an ad to see its numbers and the test it ran.

16
00:01:11.159 --> 00:01:14.106
Then plan the next test right from here.

17
00:01:15.106 --> 00:01:19.506
Learnings is how Folio gets smarter with every test.

18
00:01:19.556 --> 00:01:24.574
Each winner, and the losers worth a look, waits here for a review.

19
00:01:24.624 --> 00:01:28.226
Open one, and Folio explains why it worked.

20
00:01:28.276 --> 00:01:31.783
Agree or disagree, so it learns your brand.

21
00:01:31.833 --> 00:01:37.033
Then pick the part that made the difference, and say why in your own words.

22
00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:39.900
That goes into your playbook as a lesson.

23
00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:45.790
Next, choose what to test, like a shorter cut, and add it to the brief.

24
00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:49.688
Folio adds it as a new variation, ready to make.

25
00:01:49.738 --> 00:01:54.486
And once enough ads back a lesson, Folio's AI starts using it.

26
00:01:55.486 --> 00:02:05.975
Also in the sidebar: Chat to talk with your team, Research for your brand, the Ad Library for ads worth saving, and Help when you're stuck.

27
00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:09.727
Replay this any time from Settings, under Help.
